    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1036">

                <pb facs="1294" n="1280" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg1280"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 E.W./1–2545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Beaulac</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-25T18:00:00-04:00">January 25, 1945—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 26—9:46 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>63. I discussed instruction 86 of January 11 with Chiriani today. He approves and
                    will make strong favorable recommendation to President.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
